### GET /api/admin/events
# Cursor feed by id ascending. Filters (AND): topic, resourceId, resourceUrl.
# Pass the response's nextAfter as ?after= for the next page; null means the end.
# limit 1..1000, default 100.

### First page
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Next page
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?after=100&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filtered by topic and resource
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?topic=reactions&resourceUrl=/blog/hello
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
